{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/isogeny-labs/crypto/pulls/4984","id":5448446689,"node_id":"PR_kwDOSMdswM8AAAABRMCy4Q","html_url":"https://github.com/isogeny-labs/crypto/pull/4984","diff_url":"https://github.com/isogeny-labs/crypto/pull/4984.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/isogeny-labs/crypto/pull/4984.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/isogeny-labs/crypto/issues/4984","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/isogeny-labs/crypto/pulls/4984/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/isogeny-labs/crypto/pulls/4984/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/isogeny-labs/crypto/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/isogeny-labs/crypto/issues/4984/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/isogeny-labs/crypto/statuses/2d72aeb4c0f89d09f271307d09dad4ccb530e0d5","number":4984,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Implement Curve25519 section predicates and coefficient-degree audit","user":{"login":"aburan28","id":1086874,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwODY4NzQ=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1086874?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/aburan28","html_url":"https://github.com/aburan28","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aburan28/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aburan28/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aburan28/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aburan28/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aburan28/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aburan28/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aburan28/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aburan28/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aburan28/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## Implemented component\n\nThe original distinct-raw torus window now has a separate Rust supplied-coefficient predicate: first-power membership plus a three-doubling denominator unit guard, retaining map guards and unchanged original indexed witness/group replay. A written conditional Fp norm argument explains the reduction; it does not establish a coefficient solver or a full formal theorem. [pcc:unverified]\n\n- Frozen worker:1810 records,1770 supported signed toy rows with original replay,22 explicit two-torsion chart refusals across1792 tuples,16 supported identity-R cases; original actual q213156431/a60824497 controls at k31/k20633 extract supplied j1..6,t0. Coefficients are constructed, not discovered. Native PCC-20261123-ddf583. [pcc:unverified]\n- Exact toy coefficient degrees:2,14,26,38,50,62,74,86. The written literal-generator degree is4qk-10; this rejects only a constant-degree claim for this encoding, not arbitrary solvers or index calculus. PCC-20261123-eae0ef. [pcc:unverified]\n- Four focused release tests,fmt,strict all-target Clippy and source qualification pass locally. Two existing-law Lean endpoints pass the pinned maintained file audit,2 theorems/0 failing/0 trusted, standard axioms; PCC548372/aa408d. Full trace/norm/native/degree bridges remain open. All standing unsigned. [pcc:unverified]\n- Inspected two-page report and editable flow/exact-degree plot: [REPORT.md](https://github.com/isogeny-labs/crypto/blob/lane/curve25519-exponent/research/curve25519_torus_native_20261115/reports/section-coeff-v1/REPORT.md), [PDF](https://github.com/isogeny-labs/crypto/blob/lane/curve25519-exponent/research/curve25519_torus_native_20261115/reports/section-coeff-v1/report.pdf). Report PCC-ce55d8. [pcc:unverified]\n\nThe earlier supplied-section quotient query, interval restriction, original source/criteria/report/evidence and consumer source pin98b6b736a53412ef86f02f9e789edc393af1fc20 are retained. The new native closure is41 inputs: unchanged30-input context plus11-input delta. Full raw JSONL4581082bytes/7b59c8519927 is retained losslessly; no full actual-base enumeration, paid job, benchmark, target cohort or solver campaign. [pcc:unverified]\n\n## Publication and integration gates\n\nThe trusted artifact-autofix workflow must upload/replay these actual-policy-selected archives and commit real receipts before upload is considered complete:\n\n- native-run-v1.tar.xz:164272bytes, SHA2568f7b6024a389f032ed7d5342d7b1e2422ea002a23673accda283de154332916a.\n- reports/section-coeff-v1/first-layout.tar.xz:201084bytes, SHA25688925b1a3c7dcf40cbe81840122ed0d1168263a77c39e931872a0962f1667335.\n\n[PUBLISHING.md](https://github.com/isogeny-labs/crypto/blob/lane/curve25519-exponent/research/curve25519_torus_native_20261115/section-coeff-v1/PUBLISHING.md) records pending standing. No policy/exemption, credential export, invented receipt or remote deletion. Current PDF follows the existing keep policy. [pcc:unverified]\n\nMain7aa303f6ae has1585 ledger rows; previously published lane4df6bacdef has1568. Their common prefix is1564 and neither published history is a prefix of the other. New work retains the full published lane prefix; no already-published event is selected, re-registered or rechained. Preservation-consistent canonical integration is a separate blocker, with immutable readbacks in the study. [pcc:unverified]\n\nWhole whitespace/prose lint is not represented as green: one raw test EOF advisory is preserved; the already native/claim-pinned SOURCES.md negative-scope caveat has one missing-tag advisory, with citation-only SOURCES_V2 alongside it. Eight inherited ACTIVE prose flags remain unchanged. Selected current owned prose and own journal suffix lint0. Two unpublished malformed initial Lean PCC bindings were retained outside active claims and replaced through maintained source-binding/writer tools before publication; published histories remain intact. [pcc:unverified]\n\n## Scientific successor and hosted validation\n\nUnknown-coefficient circuit extension/projection and a structured elimination/root-extraction cost bound remain open; complete cold work, useful yield/rank, family, private selection, indexing, memory, kernel and recovery still count. No changed attack exponent, full-base solve or novelty clearance is established. [pcc:unverified]\n\nFresh-head applicable validation-gate/size/artifacts, reviews and merge state must be read after publication; no earlier-head outcome is carried forward. MERGE auto-merge stays deferred while actual author gates or review/history blockers remain. No bypass, empty refresh commit, unrelated baseline repair or broad root-library rerun.\n\nHistorical pre-update head365a diagnoses remain only historical: artifact Git-history recovery failed before native compilation; canonical wire_workflows/test_pcc NameErrors, old claim/journal flags, frozen leaderboard input and shared-code lock issues were observed then. Main has advanced since; those outcomes are not asserted for the new head. PR4526 closure and its historical published-registration gap are already recorded, with revert review due Dec1; no duplicate closure or early check.\n","labels":[],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2026-11-23T06:43:30Z","updated_at":"2026-11-23T16:33:40Z","closed_at":"2026-11-23T16:33:37Z","merged_at":"2026-11-23T16:33:36Z","merge_commit_sha":"eff3167e05a6509d8c266422567b5528e29b763f","assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"head":{"label":"isogeny-labs:lane/curve25519-exponent","ref":"lane/curve25519-exponent","repo":{"id":1221029056,"node_id":"R_kgDOSMdswA","name":"crypto","full_name":"isogeny-labs/crypto","owner":{"login":"isogeny-labs","id":347052081,"node_id":"O_kgDOFK-YMQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/347052081?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/isogeny-labs","html_url":"https://github.com/isogeny-labs","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/isogeny-labs/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.co